# ==============================================================================
# Environment Configuration (Copy to .env.local — never commit .env.local)
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. REAL EMAIL DISPATCH CONFIGURATION (Choose Option A, B, or C)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Option A: Resend (Recommended for Next.js & Vercel — https://resend.com)
# Free 3,000 emails/month, 100 emails/day, instant signup:
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_1234567890abcdef
# RESEND_FROM="Portfolio Inquiries <onboarding@resend.dev>"

# Option B: Direct Gmail SMTP via Nodemailer
# Generate a 16-character App Password at: https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
# GMAIL_USER=shemcena@gmail.com
# GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=xxxx xxxx xxxx xxxx

# Option C: Web3Forms (Zero-setup REST API — https://web3forms.com)
# Get a free key in 5 seconds sent to shemcena@gmail.com:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=your_access_key_here
# WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=your_access_key_here

# Recipient Email (defaults to shemcena@gmail.com if omitted)
CONTACT_EMAIL=shemcena@gmail.com

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. AI CHATBOT (Google Gemini API)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Get your free key at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
GOOGLE_GENERATIVE_AI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
